Research portfolio export

Local training, data conversion, evaluation, and experiment analysis are
packaged from the completed local research workspace. Original paper methods
and upstream implementations are attributed in docs/references.md.

No model weights or third-party datasets are redistributed. Upstream projects
are fetched separately at recorded revisions and retain their original licenses.
Local adaptations are identified in docs/reproducibility.md. Historical aggregate
results predate this public packaging; public packaging checks are not new GPU runs.

The BFCL RLLA handler in adapters/bfcl/rlla_qwen.py is adapted from the
Apache-2.0 official ToolRL handler, with namespace and per-request dialogue
changes for the pinned BFCL V3 interface.
